Some problems show up in every field. A workbook that takes a minute to open. Twenty near-identical files that need the same cleanup. A chart that wants one more step than the tool allows.

This site starts with the problem and then shows a way to solve it that doesn't take much effort. The tool is usually Julia, because it is pleasant to work in as well as fast. You don't need to learn it first.

= Where to start

- The #link("/blog.html")[blog] collects the problems and fixes, one at a time.
- The #link("https://www.youtube.com/@Diary_Mad_Data_Scientist")[YouTube channel] has the same ideas as short videos.
- If your data has places in it, see #link("https://juliamapping.com")[Julia Mapping: A Practical Guide].

